Subject: Keep original animation decode functions in their whole source TU

Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Restore the original twelve-bit unpack assignments and all four original
rotation/GQR entry points in SAnimDecode.cpp. Lower only the fixed signed
paired-single quantized loads, host-order stores, and GQR register setup.
The native platform helper has no game types or packing/selection decisions.
Keep the console instructions and scalar scale/weight bodies unchanged.

diff --git a/src/Game/SAnimDecode.cpp b/src/Game/SAnimDecode.cpp
--- a/src/Game/SAnimDecode.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/SAnimDecode.cpp
@@ -2,31 +2,51 @@
 
